{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rosavane Borers LLC is a mining exploration simulator that puts you in the driver\u2019s helmet of your very own customizable miner. Dig tunnels, discover precious gems and ores, then sell your haul to upgrade equipment and reach greater depths\u2014all rendered in charming hand\u2011drawn pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Miner</strong> <br>Personalize your character\u2019s appearance with over <strong><i>200 customization options</i></strong>\u2014including hairstyles, outfits, and more\u2014to create a miner that\u2019s uniquely you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844580/extras/cbdd18d25cc0b3dbf2f49c9977eef149.avif?t=1772391153\" width=423 height=237 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand\u2011Drawn Pixel Art</strong> <br>Every rock, crystal and cavern wall is lovingly crafted in hand\u2011drawn pixel style, creating a vibrant and immersive mining world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tool Upgrades &amp; Progression</strong> <br>Earn coins by selling your findings, then invest in better pickaxes and other special tools to dig deeper and faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong> <br>Balance your cargo holds\u2014decide which gems to keep and which to trade for maximum profit and performance boosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your mining adventure with Rosavane Borers LLC today\u2014dig, discover, and dominate the depths!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\u3010Characters\u3011</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_